  "source_title": "中国十大帝王陵，秦始皇陵连前三都没进#未解之谜 #考古发现 #历史冷知识 #中国历史 #古墓",
  "title_is_metadata_not_transcript": true,
  "input_mode": "text_only",
  "status": "AI_PENDING",
  "unit_index": 1,
  "unit_count": 1,
  "all_video_unit_ids": [
    "v_bed28937e07fccd1_u01"
  ],
  "duration_s": 421.163991,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "你知道吗？咱们国家历代帝王陵寝，有名有姓的不下两百座，最不可思议的有人说是秦始皇陵世界第八大奇迹。有人说是乾陵，武则天和李治合葬，四十年，大军没挖洞，错争论起邪乎，进秦始皇陵，连前三都进不去。今天咱们就来盘点中国最不可思议的十足座帝王陵。先讲第十到第六，一个比一个悬。老规矩，开讲之前，麻烦您扣个一点个红心，让我看看都是谁在听第十名。河南巩义北宋皇陵，北宋九个皇帝，除了被金兵掳走的两个，剩下七个，加上赵匡胤他爹一共八座陵。全埋在巩义这陵最绝的地方不是大，是韩盐酸跟秦始皇陵比，跟唐乾陵比，北宋皇陵小的可怜。就拿开国皇帝赵匡胤的永昌龄来说，没有巍峨的风土，没有豪华的地宫，就一个夯土堆，前面立着石人石马孤零零站在麦田里。您可能要问了，宋朝那么富清明上河图里那么热闹，皇帝陵怎么修的这么寒酸？因为赵匡胤立了个规矩，叫驳葬，他自己就是这么做的。一座开国皇帝的陵藏在麦田里，石象生占了一千年，看着庄稼一茬一茬长，您说这是是寒酸还是通透？第九名，宁夏银川西夏亡陵在贺兰山东路一片戈壁滩上立着九座金字塔一样的土堆。西夏王朝党项人建的跟宋辽金打了将近两百年，最后被蒙古人灭了，亡灵也被砸了，烧了。但这些土堆到现在还站着快一千年了。这陵最邪乎的地方不是造型，像金字塔，是他不长草，也不落鸟。周围的戈壁上有草，唯独王陵的封土堆上寸草不生，鸟也不往上落。科学家研究了好多年，也没弄明白，到底为什么？有人说是夯土里掺了特殊材料，有人说是风水布局，您说一个被灭国的王朝留下一堆不长草的土堆，占了一千年，这世上哪儿说理去？第八名，陕西咸阳汉阳陵，汉武帝他爹，汉景帝刘启的灵。这灵最绝的不是灵，本身，是它旁边的陪葬坑。考古队挖开一看，好家伙，密密麻麻的陶俑不是兵马俑，那种真人大小的是缩小版的，只有真人三分之一大，但胳膊是木头的，能活动，身上穿着丝绸衣服，衣服早就烂了。但胳膊的关节还在几十万个陶俑，有当官的有当兵的、有太监、有宫女，还有猪马牛羊、鸡，甚至还有狗一座地下动物园。您想想，两千多年前的人做了一整套缩微版的人间社会埋在地下，这心思得有多细？第七名，陕西咸阳、唐昭陵、唐太宗李世民的陵，这陵最绝的地方不是地宫，是陪葬墓，昭陵周围埋了两百多座陪葬墓。您听听这些名字，魏征、房玄龄、李靖、秦琼、程咬金、长孙无忌、尉迟敬德，全是贞观年间响当当的人物。跟李世民打天下的那帮老兄弟死了以后，还围着他排着队守着，这还不算晚。昭陵北面祭坛上，原来立着六块浮雕叫昭陵六郡，是李世民当年骑过的六匹战马，每一匹都有名字，有故事，可惜其中两批一百多年前被人偷运出国，现在还在美国的博物馆里，四匹在国内六匹马分了两地。您说这算不算生前马上打天下？死后，战马守灵前第六名，北京昌平名十三陵，明朝十六个皇帝十三个埋在这儿。这林最绝的。不是规模，是他有一个地宫被打开了定陵万历皇帝的陵。一九五六年，考古队主动挖的中国历史上第一座也是唯一一座用科学考古方法主动发掘的皇陵地宫。打开以后，出土了三千多件文物，金冠凤冠，龙袍、金银器数不清。但那时候技术不行，很多丝绸绒袍一接触空气，当场就变黑变脆碎，掉了三千件文物。后来搬来搬去，存放条件一直不好，直到二零一五年才重新搬回地下，这回是恒温恒湿专门盖的库房。您说一座主动挖开的皇陵挖出来三千件宝贝，结果保护不了，又送回去，这事是教训还是幸运？从第十到第六，北宋皇陵藏在麦田里西夏王陵不长草，不落鸟汉阳陵，埋着几十万缩微陶俑唐昭陵两百个，老兄弟守着明定陵三千件文物挖出来又送回去。可这五座还不是最邪乎，接下来第五到第一，一座比一座悬有一座陵山，就是灵灵就是山整座山掏空铁水浇死四十万人，挖了几个月，连门都找不着，还有一座根本找不到在哪？全世界找了一百年，连影子都没见着，他是哪座，他凭什么排第一下集马上更新，您先点个关注点，开头像别走丢。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00001",
      "start_ms": 130,
      "end_ms": 830,
      "text": "你知道吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00002",
      "start_ms": 1070,
      "end_ms": 3450,
      "text": "咱们国家历代帝王陵寝，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00003",
      "start_ms": 3730,
      "end_ms": 6270,
      "text": "有名有姓的不下两百座，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00004",
      "start_ms": 6990,
      "end_ms": 12150,
      "text": "最不可思议的有人说是秦始皇陵世界第八大奇迹。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00005",
      "start_ms": 12810,
      "end_ms": 14170,
      "text": "有人说是乾陵，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00006",
      "start_ms": 14670,
      "end_ms": 16570,
      "text": "武则天和李治合葬，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00007",
      "start_ms": 17110,
      "end_ms": 17890,
      "text": "四十年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00008",
      "start_ms": 17930,
      "end_ms": 19090,
      "text": "大军没挖洞，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00009",
      "start_ms": 19450,
      "end_ms": 21430,
      "text": "错争论起邪乎，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00010",
      "start_ms": 21430,
      "end_ms": 23170,
      "text": "进秦始皇陵，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00011",
      "start_ms": 23230,
      "end_ms": 24970,
      "text": "连前三都进不去。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00012",
      "start_ms": 25690,
      "end_ms": 30900,
      "text": "今天咱们就来盘点中国最不可思议的十足座帝王陵。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00013",
      "start_ms": 31520,
      "end_ms": 33460,
      "text": "先讲第十到第六，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00014",
      "start_ms": 33700,
      "end_ms": 34720,
      "text": "一个比一个悬。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00015",
      "start_ms": 35540,
      "end_ms": 36220,
      "text": "老规矩，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00016",
      "start_ms": 36440,
      "end_ms": 37300,
      "text": "开讲之前，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00017",
      "start_ms": 37600,
      "end_ms": 39620,
      "text": "麻烦您扣个一点个红心，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00018",
      "start_ms": 39880,
      "end_ms": 42680,
      "text": "让我看看都是谁在听第十名。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00019",
      "start_ms": 43040,
      "end_ms": 44940,
      "text": "河南巩义北宋皇陵，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00020",
      "start_ms": 45800,
      "end_ms": 47280,
      "text": "北宋九个皇帝，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00021",
      "start_ms": 47500,
      "end_ms": 49560,
      "text": "除了被金兵掳走的两个，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00022",
      "start_ms": 49780,
      "end_ms": 50820,
      "text": "剩下七个，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00023",
      "start_ms": 51140,
      "end_ms": 54640,
      "text": "加上赵匡胤他爹一共八座陵。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00024",
      "start_ms": 55060,
      "end_ms": 59320,
      "text": "全埋在巩义这陵最绝的地方不是大，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00025",
      "start_ms": 59520,
      "end_ms": 62255,
      "text": "是韩盐酸跟秦始皇陵比，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00026",
      "start_ms": 62700,
      "end_ms": 64095,
      "text": "跟唐乾陵比，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00027",
      "start_ms": 64520,
      "end_ms": 66805,
      "text": "北宋皇陵小的可怜。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00028",
      "start_ms": 67700,
      "end_ms": 70825,
      "text": "就拿开国皇帝赵匡胤的永昌龄来说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00029",
      "start_ms": 71370,
      "end_ms": 72965,
      "text": "没有巍峨的风土，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00030",
      "start_ms": 73400,
      "end_ms": 74935,
      "text": "没有豪华的地宫，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00031",
      "start_ms": 75270,
      "end_ms": 76590,
      "text": "就一个夯土堆，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00032",
      "start_ms": 76830,
      "end_ms": 80125,
      "text": "前面立着石人石马孤零零站在麦田里。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00033",
      "start_ms": 80740,
      "end_ms": 81725,
      "text": "您可能要问了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00034",
      "start_ms": 82180,
      "end_ms": 85525,
      "text": "宋朝那么富清明上河图里那么热闹，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00035",
      "start_ms": 85870,
      "end_ms": 87895,
      "text": "皇帝陵怎么修的这么寒酸？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00036",
      "start_ms": 88620,
      "end_ms": 90300,
      "text": "因为赵匡胤立了个规矩，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00037",
      "start_ms": 90440,
      "end_ms": 91325,
      "text": "叫驳葬，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00038",
      "start_ms": 91700,
      "end_ms": 93085,
      "text": "他自己就是这么做的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00039",
      "start_ms": 93860,
      "end_ms": 97485,
      "text": "一座开国皇帝的陵藏在麦田里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00040",
      "start_ms": 97870,
      "end_ms": 99495,
      "text": "石象生占了一千年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00041",
      "start_ms": 99950,
      "end_ms": 101945,
      "text": "看着庄稼一茬一茬长，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00042",
      "start_ms": 102520,
      "end_ms": 105465,
      "text": "您说这是是寒酸还是通透？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00043",
      "start_ms": 106140,
      "end_ms": 106835,
      "text": "第九名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00044",
      "start_ms": 107320,
      "end_ms": 115725,
      "text": "宁夏银川西夏亡陵在贺兰山东路一片戈壁滩上立着九座金字塔一样的土堆。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00045",
      "start_ms": 116240,
      "end_ms": 121565,
      "text": "西夏王朝党项人建的跟宋辽金打了将近两百年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00046",
      "start_ms": 121970,
      "end_ms": 123555,
      "text": "最后被蒙古人灭了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00047",
      "start_ms": 123790,
      "end_ms": 125065,
      "text": "亡灵也被砸了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00048",
      "start_ms": 125330,
      "end_ms": 125795,
      "text": "烧了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00049",
      "start_ms": 126430,
      "end_ms": 130195,
      "text": "但这些土堆到现在还站着快一千年了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00050",
      "start_ms": 130590,
      "end_ms": 133090,
      "text": "这陵最邪乎的地方不是造型，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00051",
      "start_ms": 133090,
      "end_ms": 133995,
      "text": "像金字塔，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00052",
      "start_ms": 134350,
      "end_ms": 135290,
      "text": "是他不长草，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00053",
      "start_ms": 135530,
      "end_ms": 136265,
      "text": "也不落鸟。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00054",
      "start_ms": 137170,
      "end_ms": 139015,
      "text": "周围的戈壁上有草，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00055",
      "start_ms": 139430,
      "end_ms": 142885,
      "text": "唯独王陵的封土堆上寸草不生，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00056",
      "start_ms": 143440,
      "end_ms": 144815,
      "text": "鸟也不往上落。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00057",
      "start_ms": 145650,
      "end_ms": 147355,
      "text": "科学家研究了好多年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00058",
      "start_ms": 147630,
      "end_ms": 148410,
      "text": "也没弄明白，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00059",
      "start_ms": 148410,
      "end_ms": 149330,
      "text": "到底为什么？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00060",
      "start_ms": 149350,
      "end_ms": 152345,
      "text": "有人说是夯土里掺了特殊材料，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00061",
      "start_ms": 152840,
      "end_ms": 154875,
      "text": "有人说是风水布局，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00062",
      "start_ms": 155620,
      "end_ms": 160345,
      "text": "您说一个被灭国的王朝留下一堆不长草的土堆，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00063",
      "start_ms": 161000,
      "end_ms": 162125,
      "text": "占了一千年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00064",
      "start_ms": 163320,
      "end_ms": 165285,
      "text": "这世上哪儿说理去？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00065",
      "start_ms": 165840,
      "end_ms": 166480,
      "text": "第八名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00066",
      "start_ms": 166820,
      "end_ms": 168485,
      "text": "陕西咸阳汉阳陵，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00067",
      "start_ms": 169340,
      "end_ms": 170300,
      "text": "汉武帝他爹，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00068",
      "start_ms": 170620,
      "end_ms": 172235,
      "text": "汉景帝刘启的灵。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00069",
      "start_ms": 173050,
      "end_ms": 175300,
      "text": "这灵最绝的不是灵，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00070",
      "start_ms": 175320,
      "end_ms": 175760,
      "text": "本身，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00071",
      "start_ms": 176080,
      "end_ms": 177935,
      "text": "是它旁边的陪葬坑。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00072",
      "start_ms": 178830,
      "end_ms": 180235,
      "text": "考古队挖开一看，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00073",
      "start_ms": 180680,
      "end_ms": 181420,
      "text": "好家伙，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00074",
      "start_ms": 181840,
      "end_ms": 184660,
      "text": "密密麻麻的陶俑不是兵马俑，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00075",
      "start_ms": 184660,
      "end_ms": 187245,
      "text": "那种真人大小的是缩小版的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00076",
      "start_ms": 187730,
      "end_ms": 189710,
      "text": "只有真人三分之一大，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00077",
      "start_ms": 189790,
      "end_ms": 191215,
      "text": "但胳膊是木头的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00078",
      "start_ms": 191460,
      "end_ms": 192025,
      "text": "能活动，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00079",
      "start_ms": 192450,
      "end_ms": 194495,
      "text": "身上穿着丝绸衣服，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00080",
      "start_ms": 194850,
      "end_ms": 195965,
      "text": "衣服早就烂了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00081",
      "start_ms": 196440,
      "end_ms": 199805,
      "text": "但胳膊的关节还在几十万个陶俑，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00082",
      "start_ms": 200070,
      "end_ms": 204080,
      "text": "有当官的有当兵的、有太监、有宫女，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00083",
      "start_ms": 204300,
      "end_ms": 205840,
      "text": "还有猪马牛羊、鸡，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00084",
      "start_ms": 206140,
      "end_ms": 208835,
      "text": "甚至还有狗一座地下动物园。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00085",
      "start_ms": 209230,
      "end_ms": 209935,
      "text": "您想想，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00086",
      "start_ms": 210390,
      "end_ms": 217275,
      "text": "两千多年前的人做了一整套缩微版的人间社会埋在地下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00087",
      "start_ms": 218650,
      "end_ms": 221105,
      "text": "这心思得有多细？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00088",
      "start_ms": 222510,
      "end_ms": 223145,
      "text": "第七名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00089",
      "start_ms": 224510,
      "end_ms": 229155,
      "text": "陕西咸阳、唐昭陵、唐太宗李世民的陵，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00090",
      "start_ms": 229580,
      "end_ms": 231805,
      "text": "这陵最绝的地方不是地宫，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00091",
      "start_ms": 232130,
      "end_ms": 233175,
      "text": "是陪葬墓，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00092",
      "start_ms": 233640,
      "end_ms": 237145,
      "text": "昭陵周围埋了两百多座陪葬墓。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00093",
      "start_ms": 237960,
      "end_ms": 239415,
      "text": "您听听这些名字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00094",
      "start_ms": 239790,
      "end_ms": 247095,
      "text": "魏征、房玄龄、李靖、秦琼、程咬金、长孙无忌、尉迟敬德，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00095",
      "start_ms": 247510,
      "end_ms": 249965,
      "text": "全是贞观年间响当当的人物。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00096",
      "start_ms": 250690,
      "end_ms": 254520,
      "text": "跟李世民打天下的那帮老兄弟死了以后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00097",
      "start_ms": 254680,
      "end_ms": 257145,
      "text": "还围着他排着队守着，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00098",
      "start_ms": 257660,
      "end_ms": 258545,
      "text": "这还不算晚。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00099",
      "start_ms": 260060,
      "end_ms": 261875,
      "text": "昭陵北面祭坛上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00100",
      "start_ms": 262310,
      "end_ms": 265655,
      "text": "原来立着六块浮雕叫昭陵六郡，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00101",
      "start_ms": 266040,
      "end_ms": 269565,
      "text": "是李世民当年骑过的六匹战马，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00102",
      "start_ms": 270250,
      "end_ms": 271590,
      "text": "每一匹都有名字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00103",
      "start_ms": 271710,
      "end_ms": 272435,
      "text": "有故事，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00104",
      "start_ms": 273830,
      "end_ms": 279895,
      "text": "可惜其中两批一百多年前被人偷运出国，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00105",
      "start_ms": 280530,
      "end_ms": 282355,
      "text": "现在还在美国的博物馆里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00106",
      "start_ms": 283220,
      "end_ms": 286915,
      "text": "四匹在国内六匹马分了两地。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00107",
      "start_ms": 287280,
      "end_ms": 290645,
      "text": "您说这算不算生前马上打天下？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00108",
      "start_ms": 291150,
      "end_ms": 291650,
      "text": "死后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00109",
      "start_ms": 291690,
      "end_ms": 294815,
      "text": "战马守灵前第六名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00110",
      "start_ms": 295830,
      "end_ms": 297405,
      "text": "北京昌平名十三陵，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00111",
      "start_ms": 298330,
      "end_ms": 301275,
      "text": "明朝十六个皇帝十三个埋在这儿。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00112",
      "start_ms": 302270,
      "end_ms": 303535,
      "text": "这林最绝的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00113",
      "start_ms": 305130,
      "end_ms": 305890,
      "text": "不是规模，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00114",
      "start_ms": 306250,
      "end_ms": 313069,
      "text": "是他有一个地宫被打开了定陵万历皇帝的陵。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00115",
      "start_ms": 314670,
      "end_ms": 315690,
      "text": "一九五六年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00116",
      "start_ms": 315890,
      "end_ms": 325350,
      "text": "考古队主动挖的中国历史上第一座也是唯一一座用科学考古方法主动发掘的皇陵地宫。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00117",
      "start_ms": 325350,
      "end_ms": 326110,
      "text": "打开以后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00118",
      "start_ms": 326390,
      "end_ms": 328370,
      "text": "出土了三千多件文物，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00119",
      "start_ms": 328890,
      "end_ms": 329990,
      "text": "金冠凤冠，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00120",
      "start_ms": 330490,
      "end_ms": 332930,
      "text": "龙袍、金银器数不清。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00121",
      "start_ms": 333370,
      "end_ms": 334785,
      "text": "但那时候技术不行，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00122",
      "start_ms": 335450,
      "end_ms": 338670,
      "text": "很多丝绸绒袍一接触空气，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00123",
      "start_ms": 339050,
      "end_ms": 341610,
      "text": "当场就变黑变脆碎，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00124",
      "start_ms": 341670,
      "end_ms": 344110,
      "text": "掉了三千件文物。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00125",
      "start_ms": 344330,
      "end_ms": 345550,
      "text": "后来搬来搬去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00126",
      "start_ms": 345990,
      "end_ms": 347590,
      "text": "存放条件一直不好，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00127",
      "start_ms": 347810,
      "end_ms": 351470,
      "text": "直到二零一五年才重新搬回地下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00128",
      "start_ms": 352270,
      "end_ms": 356270,
      "text": "这回是恒温恒湿专门盖的库房。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00129",
      "start_ms": 356510,
      "end_ms": 362010,
      "text": "您说一座主动挖开的皇陵挖出来三千件宝贝，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00130",
      "start_ms": 362370,
      "end_ms": 363745,
      "text": "结果保护不了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00131",
      "start_ms": 364080,
      "end_ms": 364845,
      "text": "又送回去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00132",
      "start_ms": 365570,
      "end_ms": 367705,
      "text": "这事是教训还是幸运？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00133",
      "start_ms": 368080,
      "end_ms": 369465,
      "text": "从第十到第六，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00134",
      "start_ms": 369760,
      "end_ms": 373610,
      "text": "北宋皇陵藏在麦田里西夏王陵不长草，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00135",
      "start_ms": 373610,
      "end_ms": 375290,
      "text": "不落鸟汉阳陵，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00136",
      "start_ms": 375330,
      "end_ms": 378890,
      "text": "埋着几十万缩微陶俑唐昭陵两百个，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00137",
      "start_ms": 378890,
      "end_ms": 383145,
      "text": "老兄弟守着明定陵三千件文物挖出来又送回去。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00138",
      "start_ms": 383690,
      "end_ms": 387015,
      "text": "可这五座还不是最邪乎，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00139",
      "start_ms": 388180,
      "end_ms": 390075,
      "text": "接下来第五到第一，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00140",
      "start_ms": 391310,
      "end_ms": 394540,
      "text": "一座比一座悬有一座陵山，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00141",
      "start_ms": 394540,
      "end_ms": 400610,
      "text": "就是灵灵就是山整座山掏空铁水浇死四十万人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00142",
      "start_ms": 400610,
      "end_ms": 401430,
      "text": "挖了几个月，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00143",
      "start_ms": 401610,
      "end_ms": 402995,
      "text": "连门都找不着，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00144",
      "start_ms": 403360,
      "end_ms": 405705,
      "text": "还有一座根本找不到在哪？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00145",
      "start_ms": 406200,
      "end_ms": 407985,
      "text": "全世界找了一百年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00146",
      "start_ms": 408530,
      "end_ms": 410115,
      "text": "连影子都没见着，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00147",
      "start_ms": 410950,
      "end_ms": 411670,
      "text": "他是哪座，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00148",
      "start_ms": 411810,
      "end_ms": 414945,
      "text": "他凭什么排第一下集马上更新，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00149",
      "start_ms": 416000,
      "end_ms": 418420,
      "text": "您先点个关注点，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bed28937e07fccd1_s00150",
      "start_ms": 418420,
      "end_ms": 421095,
      "text": "开头像别走丢。"
    }
  ],
